Please, Sam, help me get this off me.

16:27.760 --> 16:28.760
Sam, what's going on around here?

16:28.760 --> 16:29.760
I'll tell you later.

16:29.760 --> 16:30.760
What time is it?

16:30.760 --> 16:31.760
Ten past three.

